1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,798
Rose: Alexa, I'm just going to take my blood thinner.

2
00:00:03,248 --> 00:00:12,699
Alexa: Hold on, Rose. Grace gave you today's warfarin at 9:10 this morning. Your warfarin is once a day, so not another until tomorrow.

3
00:00:13,699 --> 00:00:15,870
Tom: Alexa, what did I miss with Mom today?

4
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:34,814
Alexa: Since you last checked in, on Sunday at 7:30 pm, here's what's new. A note from Grace. Mom slept well and ate all her lunch. Grace gave Mom her warfarin at 9:10 this morning. At 1:40 this afternoon, Mom went to take a second warfarin and I stopped her.

5
00:00:35,814 --> 00:00:36,836
Tom: Why did you stop her?

6
00:00:37,286 --> 00:00:46,992
Alexa: I stopped a second warfarin for Mom because Ada set it 12 days ago, to once a day. Grace gave Mom today's warfarin at 9:10 this morning.

7
00:00:47,992 --> 00:00:51,986
Ada: Alexa, Mom's cardiology moved to Thursday at 10. Sort it out.

8
00:00:52,436 --> 00:01:09,096
Alexa: Done. Mom's cardiology is now Thursday at 10:00 am. Tom is taking Mom, since Tom does Thursdays. I cancelled the old ride, booked a ride for 9:15 am, and told Tom and Grace on the family board.

9
00:01:10,096 --> 00:01:13,265
Grace: Alexa, we're nearly out of her warfarin. Reorder it.

10
00:01:13,715 --> 00:01:22,237
Alexa: Warfarin 5 mg, 30 tablets, $12.40 from the Hearth sandbox pharmacy, delivered tomorrow. Shall I place the order?

11
00:01:23,237 --> 00:01:24,329
Grace: Yes, go ahead.

12
00:01:24,779 --> 00:01:33,370
Alexa: Done. Warfarin 5 mg, 30 tablets is ordered, 12 dollars 40, arriving tomorrow. I've told the family.

13
00:01:34,370 --> 00:01:36,088
Tom: Alexa, can Mom have a coffee?

14
00:01:36,538 --> 00:01:46,407
Alexa: Mom's coffee stops at three. Ada set it 12 days ago, to three. Tom said six, but Ada has the say over what she eats and drinks.

15
00:01:47,407 --> 00:01:49,299
Ada: Mom finished the antibiotics.

16
00:01:49,749 --> 00:01:57,179
Alexa: Understood, the antibiotics are over. Ada's rule that Mom's alcohol is off limits no longer applies.

17
00:01:58,179 --> 00:01:59,921
Ada: Alexa, show me the record.

18
00:02:00,371 --> 00:02:06,942
Alexa: 9 calls on the record, 1 refused, and the chain is intact: nothing has been edited or removed.

